## Resolution Summary
Added the missing ContainerPort.Protocol defaulting to ContainerDefaults in podspec.go, exactly as suggested by the reviewer. The loop sets Protocol to corev1.ProtocolTCP for any port that has an empty Protocol field. The function's doc comment was updated to mention ContainerPort.Protocol. A corresponding test case was added to TestContainerDefaults in podspec_test.go that exercises both the empty-protocol default (TCP) and an explicitly set UDP protocol.

